otaripper
=========

Static ARM64 payload extractor used by high-speed full OTA flashing
(TW_HIGHSPEED_FLASHING). Installed to /system/bin/otaripper.

Upstream: https://github.com/syedinsaf/otaripper (Apache-2.0, see otaripper.LICENSE)
Build:    modified, provides --direct-fd, --readback, --readback-for,
          --no-open and --strict used by twrpinstall/highspeed.cpp
SHA-256:  cd3b7433d2d3e1faf6ef077e47813c88a7de1b69ac07f881fac6199428a4b5f4

Update the checksum above whenever the binary is replaced.
